  "Order = priority: the three scan chains (independent, run in parallel when slots allow), the neutral-start optimisations,",
  "then the single points (they need all three chains), the PCM-minimum single points, then the DVR (seconds, 1 thread).",
  "est_hours: msi-class speed at 4 threads (i3-1115G4: gas SCF+gradient about 6.7 min per optimisation step, PCM about 17 min),",
